# FULL PEAL, stage C's foes. A mote appears right on the plane (harmless
# for a moment while it shimmers in) and drifts straight at where the
# ship was. A nibbler appears the same way, chases, and takes two hits. A
# bourdon, a great bell, swings in from a side to a lane marked on the
# plane, drops onto it, sits, and goes: nothing can hurt it and it doesn't
# count in the grade. A spite is a pendulum that bursts in a cross when
# shot. A quick sally comes in much faster than a sally.
game fullpeal
wait 12
press A
cheat sandbox
cheat god
cheat pos -2.5 1.5
# the mote, in the top right lane
cheat foe 12 5 0 0
expect kind_z100_12 == 0
expect kind_x100_12 == 250
expect kind_t_12 < 0
waituntil kind_t_12 >= 0 40
wait 40
expect kind_x100_12 < 250
expect kind_y100_12 > -150
waituntil foes_12 == 0 500
expect wave_escaped == 1
# the nibbler chases and takes two
cheat foe 13 5 1 0
expect kind_hp_13 == 2
waituntil kind_t_13 >= 0 40
wait 60
expect kind_x100_13 < 250
cheat pos -2.5 -0.5
cheat endwave
wait 30
# the bourdon: from the left to column 3, row 1
cheat foe 4 -1 1 3
expect kind_hp_4 == 0
waituntil kind_state_4 == 1 300
expect kind_x100_4 == 50
expect kind_y100_4 == -50
expect kind_z100_4 == 0
# nothing hurts it
cheat pos -1.5 -0.5
hold LEFT
hold B
wait 1
release LEFT
wait 30
release
expect foes_4 == 1
waituntil foes_4 == 0 400
expect wave_escaped == 1
# the spite, shot down out in the distance, still sends its cross down
cheat still
cheat foez 8 0.5 0.5 0.4
cheat pos 0.5 0.5
hold A 12
expect foes_8 == 0
expect eshots_shell == 1
cheat still
waituntil eshots_plane == 4 60
# a quick sally is quicker than a sally
cheat endwave
wait 120
cheat foe 9 0 0 0
cheat foe 10 5 3 0
wait 30
expect kind_z100_9 == 82
expect kind_z100_10 == 68
